category: Libs
build-depends: cygport check
sdesc: "Lightweight configuration file library (utilities)"
ldesc: "liblcfg is a lightweight configuration file library written in C99. The file
format supports arbitrarily nested simple assignments, lists and maps (aka
dictionaries)."
